📂 Main Components
- PcapReader --- reads packets from PCAP files.
- PacketParser --- extracts Ethernet, IP, protocol and port
  information.
- SniExtractor --- detects TLS SNI and HTTP Host information.
- RuleManager --- stores and checks filtering rules.
- DpiEngine --- coordinates DPI processing.
- FastPath --- performs packet inspection and filtering.
- LoadBalancer --- distributes packets between processing workers.
- ThreadSafeQueue --- supports safe producer/consumer
  communication.
- ConnectionTracker --- tracks network flows.
- Types --- shared packet, flow and application structures.
- MainDpi --- command-line entry point.
