>>>>▶️ How to Run
1. Compile
Open PowerShell in the project directory:
.\compile.bat

2. Run the DPI engine
.\RUN_PROJECT.bat
Or run the main class directly:
java -cp bin dpi.MainDpi test_dpi.pcap output_java.pcap

3. Block an IP
java -cp bin dpi.MainDpi test_dpi.pcap output_java.pcap --block-ip 100.1.168.192

4. Block a domain
java -cp bin dpi.MainDpi test_dpi.pcap output_java.pcap --block-domain youtube.com


5. Block a domain pattern
java -cp bin dpi.MainDpi test_dpi.pcap output_java.pcap --block-domain "*.youtube.com"

6. Use a rules file
java -cp bin dpi.MainDpi test_dpi.pcap output_java.pcap --rules rules.txt
