📌 Important Limitation
The current implementation follows:
PCAP → Java DPI Engine → Filtered PCAP
It analyzes captured packets rather than intercepting a user's live
Internet traffic. Live network enforcement would require an additional
packet-capture/interception layer and operating-system integration.
